\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Real-time tracking of plasma-dependent magnetic-field dynamics. Plasma stored energy from conventional HSX diagnostics is compared with the amplified AlGaN/GaN Hall-effect sensor output for (a), (a$'$)~a high-energy discharge (shot 21); (b), (b$'$)~a late-breakdown discharge (shot 18); and (c), (c$'$)~a failed-breakdown case (shot 19). The two data acquisition systems have a $\sim $30 ms relative timing offset due to delayed triggering.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:track}{{5}{3}{}{figure.5}{}}
